# EUReadySeller Release Gate

No task is complete until source, build, and live checks pass.

## Required checks
Run the applicable checks before marking work done:
- `npm run build`
- `npm run validate` if available
- `npm run validate:claims` if available
- `npm run validate:routes` if available
- `npm run validate:seo` if available
- `npm run validate:links` if available
- `npm run validate:schema` if available
- `npm run validate:content-roadmap` if available
- `npm run validate:artifacts` if available
- External live curl checks with cache-busting for every changed URL

## Live verification expectations
For every changed page, verify on the public site:
- HTTP 200
- expected H1 and title
- canonical trailing slash
- required phrases present
- forbidden phrases absent
- internal links present
- no cross-project contamination
- sitemap.xml includes the page
- llms.txt includes the page

## Completion status
Final status must be one of:
- `GSC_READY`
- `NEEDS_FIX`

Do not treat a task as done if live verification has not passed.
